## 2. Product decisions

| Decision | Choice | Reason |
|---|---|---|
| Product name | **DisplayManager** (repo folder name) | Respect existing name |
| Installed app | `/Applications/DisplayManager.app` | Requirement |
| Bundle id | `com.bachana.DisplayManager` (single variable in build script) | Assumption; changing later resets preferences and login item |
| Minimum macOS | **14.0 Sonoma** | `@Observable`, `NSApp.activate()`, `NSMenuItem.sectionHeader`, SMAppService (13) |
| Dock icon | None. `LSUIElement = true` (accessory app) | Menu bar utility |
| Architecture | Native arm64 build only (the host arch) | Universal builds need Xcode's build system |
| Language | Swift 6 language mode, strict concurrency | Correctness |
| UI | AppKit lifecycle + SwiftUI views hosted in `NSHostingController` | See 4.2 |
| Third-party deps | None | Requirement |
| Sandbox | **Off** (required: must exec `displayplacer` and read IORegistry) | Local distribution |
| Hardened runtime | On (harmless; keeps notarization possible later) | |
| Signing | Ad-hoc (`codesign --sign -`) | No paid developer account needed |
| Defaults | Auto Apply ON, Reapply After Wake ON, Launch at Login OFF (user opts in), no shortcuts assigned | Safe defaults; rules must exist before anything auto-applies |

