## 6. macOS APIs

| Need | API |
|---|---|
| Menu bar item | `NSStatusBar.system.statusItem(withLength: .squareLength)`, `NSStatusBarButton`, `sendAction(on: [.leftMouseDown, .rightMouseDown])`, `NSMenu` + `NSMenuDelegate` |
| Icon | `NSImage(systemSymbolName: "display")`, `isTemplate = true`; error state `display.trianglebadge.exclamationmark` |
| Windows | `NSWindow`, `NSHostingController`, `NSTabViewController(tabStyle: .toolbar)` for Settings, `NSApp.activate()` |
| Save prompt, errors | `NSAlert` with accessory view |
| Import/export | `NSOpenPanel`, `NSSavePanel`, `UTType.json` |
| Live displays | `CGGetOnlineDisplayList`, `CGDisplayIsBuiltin`, `CGDisplayIsMain`, `CGDisplayVendorNumber`, `CGDisplayModelNumber`, `CGDisplaySerialNumber`, `CGDisplayBounds`, `CGDisplayRotation`, `CGDisplayCopyDisplayMode`, `CGDisplayCreateUUIDFromDisplayID`, `NSScreen.localizedName` (via `NSScreenNumber`) |
| Display events | `CGDisplayRegisterReconfigurationCallback`, `NSApplication.didChangeScreenParametersNotification` (secondary) |
| Port topology | IOKit: `IOServiceGetMatchingServices(kIOMainPortDefault, IOServiceMatching("IOPortTransportStateDisplayPort"))`, `IORegistryEntryCreateCFProperties`, `IORegistryEntryGetParentEntry(kIOServicePlane)`, `IORegistryEntryGetName`, `IORegistryEntryGetLocationInPlane`; notifications `IONotificationPortCreate`, `IONotificationPortSetDispatchQueue(.main)`, `IOServiceAddMatchingNotification` (`kIOFirstMatchNotification`, `kIOTerminatedNotification`) |
| Host model | `sysctlbyname("hw.model")` |
| Sleep/wake/session | `NSWorkspace.shared.notificationCenter`: `willSleepNotification`, `didWakeNotification`, `screensDidWakeNotification`, `sessionDidResignActiveNotification`, `sessionDidBecomeActiveNotification` |
| Run displayplacer | `Process` (`executableURL`, `arguments`), `Pipe` |
| Launch at Login | `SMAppService.mainApp` |
| Global shortcuts | Carbon `RegisterEventHotKey`, `InstallEventHandler(GetApplicationEventTarget(), …kEventHotKeyPressed…)`, `CopySymbolicHotKeys` |
| Open Displays settings | `NSWorkspace.shared.open(URL)`, `NSWorkspace.shared.openApplication(at:configuration:)` |
| Logging | `os.Logger` |
| Persistence | `JSONEncoder/Decoder` (`.iso8601`, sorted keys, pretty), `Data.write(options: .atomic)`, `UserDefaults` |

